Smart College Assistant — Project Documentation
1. Project Overview
Project name: Smart College Assistant
Project type: Web-based application
Domain: Education and conversational AI
Difficulty: Beginner to intermediate
Estimated development time: 7–14 days for a basic, polished version
1.1 Problem statement
Students frequently need information about college admissions, courses, fee structures, examination schedules, scholarships, departments, and campus facilities.

This information may be scattered across college websites, notices, PDFs, and administrative offices. Students may have to search multiple sources or contact staff to get simple answers.

The Smart College Assistant aims to provide a centralized, user-friendly chatbot through which students can ask college-related questions and receive relevant answers instantly.
1.2 Proposed solution
We will develop a web application that allows students to interact with a chatbot through a browser.

The chatbot will:
- Answer frequently asked questions about the institution.
- Provide information about admissions, courses, fees, examinations, and facilities.
- Match questions with relevant information stored in a database.
- Handle unknown questions gracefully.
- Maintain a conversation history during a chat session.
- Allow an administrator to add, update, and delete FAQs.
- Provide a responsive interface that works on laptops and mobile devices.
1.3 Project objectives
1. Reduce the time students spend searching for college information.
2. Provide a simple interface for accessing frequently requested information.
3. Demonstrate frontend and backend integration.
4. Learn database operations through a practical application.
5. Implement basic natural-language question matching.
6. Build a maintainable project that can be extended with AI features later.
2. Scope of the Project
We will divide the application into three levels.
Level	Features	Priority
Basic	Chat interface, predefined FAQs, question matching, fallback response	Essential
Intermediate	Database integration, conversation history, admin panel, feedback	Recommended
